# Mona Project Structure

Mona is a real-time application for deploying AI agents

## Key Directories

### `frontend/`
Contains the React-based frontend application built with Vite.

```
frontend/
├── public/         - Static assets
├── src/            - Source code
│   ├── components/ - Components used by the app
│   │   ├── ui/     - UI components built with shadcn and Framer motion. This contains the design system.
│   │   └── others  - Page specific components
│   ├── routes/     - Routes for the application using tanstack file-based router
│   ├── hooks/      - React hooks
│   ├── lib/        - Utility functions and libraries
│   └── main.tsx    - Main application component
├── package.json    - Frontend dependencies
├── vite.config.ts  - Vite configuration
├── biome.json      - Linter configuration
└── tsconfig.json   - TypeScript configuration
```
